### ================================================================
### bookstore - HTTP API requests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8081
###
### Development credentials:
### ADMIN: admin / admin123
### USER : demo  / password
###
### IntelliJ IDEA and VS Code REST Client can execute these requests.
### ================================================================

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### BOOKS - POSITIVE
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Public: list books
GET http://localhost:8081/api/books
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### AUTH - POSITIVE
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Register a normal USER
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### BOOKS - ADMIN POSITIVE
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Add book as ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Request-Id: add-book-admin-001

{
  "title": "Domain-Driven Design",
  "author": "Eric Evans",
  "isbn": "9780321125217",
  "price": 750.00,
  "stockQuantity": 12
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### CART - POSITIVE
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### View demo user's cart
GET http://localhost:8081/api/cart
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwYXNzd29yZA==
Accept: application/json

### Add book to demo user's cart
POST http://localhost:8081/api/cart/items
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwYXNzd29yZA==
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Update cart item
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwYXNzd29yZA==
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### Remove cart item
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwYXNzd29yZA==

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### ORDER - POSITIVE
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Checkout - Idempotency-Key is mandatory
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwYXNzd29yZA==
Idempotency-Key: 9d6d5a1e-1f5e-4d45-8c7b-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

### Repeat the previous checkout with the SAME key.
### It should return the stored response rather than create a duplicate order.
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwYXNzd29yZA==
Idempotency-Key: 9d6d5a1e-1f5e-4d45-8c7b-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

### Order history
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwYXNzd29yZA==
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### SECURITY - NEGATIVE
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### POST book without authentication -> expected 401
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthorized Book",
  "author": "Test Author",
  "isbn": "9780000000001",
  "price": 100.00,
  "stockQuantity": 5
}

### POST book with USER credentials -> expected 403
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwYXNzd29yZA==
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "User Cannot Add Book",
  "author": "Test Author",
  "isbn": "9780000000002",
  "price": 100.00,
  "stockQuantity": 5
}

### GET cart without authentication -> expected 401
GET http://localhost:8081/api/cart
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### VALIDATION - NEGATIVE
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Blank title -> expected 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "isbn": "9780000000003",
  "price": 850.00,
  "stockQuantity": 20
}

### Zero price -> expected 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid Price",
  "author": "Test Author",
  "isbn": "9780000000004",
  "price": 0,
  "stockQuantity": 10
}

### Negative stock -> expected 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/books
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid Stock",
  "author": "Test Author",
  "isbn": "9780000000005",
  "price": 500.00,
  "stockQuantity": -1
}

### Invalid cart quantity -> expected 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/cart/items
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwYXNzd29yZA==
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "quantity": 0
}

### Non-existing book -> expected 404
POST http://localhost:8081/api/cart/items
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwYXNzd29yZA==
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "bookId": 999999,
  "quantity": 1
}

### Missing Idempotency-Key -> expected 400 contract
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpwYXNzd29yZA==
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}
